5,1,1,talk,May,,I want to make sure we don't just repeat the same mistake. Who is actually carrying the weight here?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""May: I want to make sure we don't just repeat the same mistake. Who is actually carrying the weight here?""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the costs too. We need to know exactly what this setup will cost each of us, not just guess.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry less about the money and more about whether we can still be neighbors after this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I have watched this lane for decades. We must measure the true cost in time and spirit, not just yen, before we bind ourselves.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, your worry about the budget is valid, but I need to know who is physically doing the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the physical work is part of it, but I am more concerned about the daily reality of living beside it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, I’m checking the block ledger to see what we’ve already spent on fixes. It’s a start.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
