35,2,1,talk,May,,"@Kenji, I found the complaint log. Eleven of fourteen complaints came from the gate household. They are drowning.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @May, that confirms my fear. I visited the station block’s bin house; the smell is worse than the open pile.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@May, that’s heavy. I checked the ledger and subsidy. We spend thirty-four thousand yearly on fixes, but the subsidy only covers forty percent of setup.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: @May, that log is heartbreaking. I also read the residents' statements; three people admitted they wouldn't turn away a late bag.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the subsidy is a drop in the ocean. I checked the filing rules; a permanent build takes four months and five signatures.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, that bin house sounds like a trap. I also measured the frontages; one house has only ninety centimetres of pavement left.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, ninety centimetres is a safety hazard. We cannot build there. I need to know if the rotation is even physically possible for everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, the subsidy helps, but the ledger shows we bleed money yearly. We need a plan that stops the bleeding, not just a new hole.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the money is real, but the silence is worse. If we can’t even agree on who turns a bag away, how do we fix the bins?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, the silence is indeed the heaviest burden. I timed the supervised mornings; each takes fifty minutes. We must weigh that daily cost against the peace of mind.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, fifty minutes is a lot. But if we rotate, does that mean the gate household finally gets a break?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, rotation is physically impossible for the narrowest frontage. We must consider managed hours or a different structure entirely.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if rotation is out, maybe managed hours? But who watches? The ledger shows we pay for messes, not prevention.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that is the crux. If nobody wants to be the enforcer, managed hours will just create new enemies. We need a solution that doesn't require us to police each other.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, you are right. Policing breeds resentment. I propose we look at the station block’s minutes to see how their structure failed, so we avoid their mistakes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, I will look into the station block’s meeting minutes. I need to see exactly how their arrangement collapsed before we repeat it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, I agree. I will check the station block’s minutes to see how their structure failed, so we avoid their mistakes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I’ll check the station block’s minutes too. I need to see if their failure was about the structure or the people.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I will also check the station block’s minutes. I need to see if their failure was about the structure or the people.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, I have already examined the filing requirements. I will now look into the station block’s minutes to understand how their structure failed, so we avoid their mistakes.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
